### Animations triggered by code

on_player_election_nomination - global - is triggered when the player nominates a candidate for a title election

map_zoom_[0-8] - triggered when hitting zoom steps on map, interrups other zoom step animations

# Character Window
character_window_refresh - Triggered when the viewed character changes

# Combat Window
daily_tick_left_most_casualties - Every day if the left side had the most casualties
daily_tick_right_most_casualties - Every day if the right side had the most casualties
phase_change - When the combat phase changes
combat_left_roll - When the left side's roll changes
combat_right_roll - When the right side's roll changes
new_battle_event - When a new battle event is added

# Siege Window
monthly_tick_attacker_most_casualties - Every month if the attacker side had the most casualties
monthly_tick_defender_most_casualties - Every month if the defender side had the most casualties
siege_event_flash - Every time the siege action changes
siege_breach_flash - In addition to the normal flash if the action was a wall breach
siege_starvation_flash - In addtion to the normal flash if the action was stravation
siege_disease_flash - In addtion to the normal flash if the action was disease
siege_daily_progress_flash - Every day if the siege made progress
siege_window_refresh - Triggered when the viewed siege changes

# HUD
stress_level_increase - When the player's stress level increases
stress_increase - When the player's stress increases within the same stress level
stress_decrease - When the player's stress or stress level decreases
spiritual_fulfillment_change - When the player's spiritual fulfillment changes
legitimacy_level_increase - When the player's legitimacy level increases
legitimacy_level_decrease - When the player's legitimacy level decreases
merit_level_increase - When the player's merit level increases
merit_level_decrease - When the player's merit level decreases
struggle_pulse_glow - On a struggle pulse, if the struggle window is not shown
struggle_pulse_icon - On a struggle pulse, if the struggle window is not shown

# Activity Window
activity_new_event_shown - On the activity event insert, when a new event is shown
activity_hide_activity_pulse_popup - On a weekly activity pulse with a valid pulse action (interrupts first)

# Other windows
animation_amenities_change - Court amenities window, when a setting change moves grandeur across the baseline
dynastic_cycle_wheel_spin - Dynastic cycle window, when the shown era changes (interrupts first)
refresh_bookmark_tabs - My realm window, when the tab changes
main_menu_continue - Main menu, when continuing the last save
fade_out - Splash window, when starting a transition to another item
fade_in - Splash window, when the transition ends

# Misc
daily_tick - Every Day
monthly_tick - Every Month
